<title>UK: UK Q3 C/A deficit 71 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Q3 C/A deficit 71 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics issued the following seasonally adjusted, third quarter current account data -</p>
<p>    TRADE (in million stg)     Q3	  Q2		    Q3,95</p>
<p>    Current account	  -71	 344	 (792)  -1,751</p>
<p>    Trade in goods	  -2,928    -3,171 (-3,212)   -3,519</p>
<p>    Trade in services	1,768     1,764   (1,739)   1,777</p>
<p>    Investment income	1,891     3,083   (3,597)   1,742</p>
<p>    Transfers		  -802     -1,332  (-1,332)  -1,751</p>
<p>    UK Investment overseas -4,088   -4,946		-4,461</p>
<p>    O'seas investment in UK 5,038    5,947		 2,979</p>
<p>NOTE - Market forecast Q3 c/a deficit of 600 million stg, and trade in goods deficit of 3.1 billion stg.</p>
</text>
